This project is a simple home page made using only HTML and CSS.

- index.html is the main home page html.
- Style.css is the main css file for the html of home page.
- Assets is the folder that holds the local images used in the home page.
- .vscode holds the port information for vsc.

# Note: In the index.html the link tags that has googleapis.com links are fonts, they are not explicitly made as html style sheets.

SVG tag is used for little icons exported from the internet for the page icon in the tab (white heart) and the logo image (cloudy moon symbol).